---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---

<style>
	
	.welcome-box {
		max-width: 900px;
		padding: 0.7em;
	}

	.welcome-text { 
		min-width: 300px; 
		width: 100%;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.welcome-image { 
		width: calc(200px + 2vw);
	}

	p {
		width: 700px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		p, a {
			font-size: 0.9em;
		}

		h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
			font-size: 1.6em;
		}
	}
</style>
<PageLayout>
	<div class="centered">
		<img class="welcome-image" src="./sacfnb_no_outline.png" alt="The Sacramento Food Not Bombs logo, featuring a cartoon chef cat in front of the Transgender Pride flag and a raised fist holding a carrot. It says: Food Not Bombs, Sacramento. City of Trees."/>
		<br/>
		<br/>
		<h3>What is Food Not Bombs?</h3>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
		<p class="">
			<u>Food Not Bombs is a global mutual aid movement and tradition.
				We are an independent and self-organized chapter of it based in Sacramento.</u> As our name implies we believe in food for all, mutual aid, and community instead of war, hate, and profit.
		</p>
		</div>
		<br/><br/>
		<h3>What do you do?</h3>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
		<p class="">
			We back up our beliefs through our mutual aid work: <u>handing out food, water, first aid supplies, toiletries, blankets, clothes, and more</u> to our local community free of charge. We <u>cook fresh vegan meals and serve them</u> the very same day at Cesar Chavez Plaza in Downtown Sacramento on the corner of J St. & 10th St. every Sunday at 1:30 PM PST.
		</p>
		</div>
		<br/><br/>
		<h3>How can I help?</h3>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
		<p class="">
			You can help us out in a few different ways:

		</p>
		
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p><b>Volunteer to cook or hand out supplies: </b> <u>Meet us at 1:30 PM PST on any Sunday</u> (Note: Sometimes we can run as late as 2:00 PM) in <u>Downtown Sacramento on the corner of J St. and 10th St. and ask to help out!</u> After your first day, we will invite you to our "newbies" Signal group chat; from there, you could also volunteer to help out in other ways such as cooking!</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p><b>Donate to our cause: </b><a href=`/donate`>You can donate to fund our distro directly here</a>. You can also donate packaged or canned foods, bottled waters, toiletries, clothes, or other mutual aid supplies to us in person at our designated location and time.</p>
		</div>	
		<br/>	
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p><b>Share our distro to your friends: </b> Share our website or Instagram (<a href="https://www.instagram.com/sacfoodnotbombs/">@sacfoodnotbombs</a>) to anyone who you think would be interested in helping out!</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
